[For "black"]
[Kind "main"]
[Start "london-main 5...Nc6"]
[Name "The London: 6.Bd3"]

6. Bd3 { As common as 6.Nbd2. The bishop goes to its best square first. }
6... Bd6 { The same offer as ever: White's bishop on f4 is its best piece, so Black offers to trade it. [%cal Gd6f4] }
7. Bg3
7... O-O
8. Nbd2 *
